=Terraformer=
* Cost: %Minerals%40
* [[concepts/initiative|Initiative]]: 100
* [[concepts/weight|Weight]]: 2
* [[concepts/sensory|Base scanning range]]: 4
* Construction: Converts %Minerals%10 per round
* Terraforming: Can shape the surrounding terrain
This turret type can build structures in valid locations. It requires %Minerals% to initiate construction.
